From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 12:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow setuptools-scm 10

openRuyi provides setuptools-scm 10.0.5. Dropbox uses setuptools-scm only to
derive its build version, so retain the minimum version while removing the
obsolete build-only upper bound.

Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 42a3c64..41e8daf 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 [build-system]
-requires = ["setuptools>=77", "setuptools-scm>=8,<9"]
+requires = ["setuptools>=77", "setuptools-scm>=8"]
 build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"
